+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only OR MIT
+/*
+ * Device Tree Source for J784S4 and J742S2 SoC Family
+ *
+ * TRM (j784s4) (SPRUJ43 JULY 2022): https://www.ti.com/lit/zip/spruj52
